[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0715","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0715.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0602","title":"Red Hat Linux Secure Locate 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 系统中 Secure Locate (slocate) 工具存在权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可通过设置恶意的 LOCATE_PATH 环境变量，指定特制的配置文件，从而在 slocate 执行时触发该漏洞，获取目标系统的敏感信息读取权限、文件写入权限及程序执行权限。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可利用，影响 Red Hat Linux 系统安全。建议用户及时更新 slocate 至最新版本或应用厂商提供的安全补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0602"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:05Z","remediation":"立即升级 slocate 至 2.1-1 或更高版本，该版本修复了 LOCATE_PATH 环境变量处理中的配置注入漏洞。如无法升级，可移除 slocate 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/slocate），或改用 mlocate/plocate 替代。作为临时缓解措施，可在系统层面过滤 LOCATE_PATH 环境变量，限制普通用户通过该变量指定恶意配置文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1385","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.21.0006211209500.22969-100000%40nimue.tpi.pl","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0602.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0602","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0602.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0602.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hx6m-rxfx-9j6c/GHSA-hx6m-rxfx-9j6c.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0602.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0715.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0677","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0677.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0579","title":"SGI IRIX crontab 临时文件权限提升漏洞","description":"IRIX 操作系统的 crontab 命令在编辑计划任务时，会在 /tmp 目录下创建临时文件，且文件名可预测（如使用固定模式命名），同时临时文件权限继承当前用户的 umask 设置而非采用安全默认权限。本地攻击者可通过符号链接攻击或直接读写这些可预测的临时文件，在目标用户编辑 crontab 的过程中篡改其内容，从而植入恶意计划任务实现权限提升或执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 系统，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，利用条件较为苛刻（需等待目标用户编辑 crontab），但成功利用后可导致机密性、完整性和可用性部分受损。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0579"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:02Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止维护的 SGI IRIX 操作系统，官方不再提供安全补丁。建议立即将受影响的 IRIX 系统迁移至受支持的操作平台；若无法迁移，可采取以下缓解措施：(1) 严格限制本地用户登录权限，仅允许受信任的管理员账户访问系统；(2) 将 /tmp 目录挂载为 noexec 并设置粘滞位 (chmod 1777 /tmp)；(3) 在系统全局 umask 设置中强制使用 077，防止临时文件权限过低被其他用户篡改；(4) 使用 auditd 监控 /usr/bin/crontab 的异常调用行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0204.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1413","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0579.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0579","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0579.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0579.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pxpj-c4wv-6w3x/GHSA-pxpj-c4wv-6w3x.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0579.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6f1f2c9a-1115-49bf-adbc-0d6c0d8585ff.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0579.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0677.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0675","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0675.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0578","title":"SGI IRIX MIPSPro 编译器 /tmp 可预测文件名漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 系统中的 MIPSPro 编译器（C、C++、F77 和 F90）在编译过程中会在 /tmp 目录下生成临时文件，且文件名可被预测。本地攻击者可在其他用户编译时，通过创建同名符号链接或写入恶意内容到这些临时文件中，实现权限提升或数据篡改。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 系统，攻击条件为本地用户权限，CVSS 评分 3.7，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0578"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:02Z","remediation":"由于 SGI IRIX 系统已停止维护，官方不再提供补丁。建议将编译器临时文件目录通过环境变量 TMPDIR 指向用户私有目录（如 `export TMPDIR=$HOME/tmp`），避免使用共享的 /tmp 目录；或在编译前设置严格的 umask（如 `umask 077`）限制临时文件权限；最彻底的方案是迁移至受支持的编译器或操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0204.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1412","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0578.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0578","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0578.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0578.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9hpg-q52c-898c/GHSA-9hpg-q52c-898c.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0578.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--27dd7fed-1450-49c4-ae3a-4960c87b11b8.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/b3f8802d959465aac8f9cdd0806abe7fb52f94b5/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0675.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0580","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0580.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0513","title":"Easy Software Products CUPS 不存在的用户名认证拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-0513是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0513"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:53Z","remediation":"建议立即将 CUPS 升级至 1.0.5 或更高版本，或从 https://www.cups.org/ 下载并应用对应安全补丁。如需临时缓解，可在 /etc/cups/cupsd.conf 中通过 AuthType 配置限制远程认证访问，仅允许受信任主机访问 IPP 服务端口 631。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0188.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1373","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4846","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24762ffc4408618d0c62379d258b248e81056dc1/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0513.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0513","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0513.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8305d7f6f9031873a5609178b8b2d4422836eee7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0513.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-jvqm-q54c-fwxg/GHSA-jvqm-q54c-fwxg.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0513.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0513.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--af809574-968a-4de7-ad6c-8725366060b5.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0580.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0574","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0574.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0511","title":"Easy Software Products CUPS 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CUPS（通用Unix打印系统）1.04及更早版本存在拒绝服务漏洞，其Web管理界面中的CGI组件在处理远程攻击者发送的特制HTTP POST请求时无法正确解析输入数据，导致服务进程资源被耗尽或异常终止。该漏洞影响所有安装受影响版本CUPS的Unix/Linux系统，攻击者无需任何身份认证即可通过网络远程发起攻击，只要目标系统CUPS的HTTP接口可达即可触发。攻击者仅需向目标发送构造的CGI POST请求即可使CUPS打印服务停止响应，造成系统打印功能中断，CVSS v2评分5.0，危害等级为中危。Easy Software Products已在CUPS 1.0.5版本中发布补丁修复此漏洞，用户应尽快升级至安全版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0511"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:53Z","remediation":"tags.<value>立即将 CUPS 升级至 1.0.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 POST 请求拒绝服务漏洞。升级后重新启动 cupsd 服务以生效。若无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器层面禁用对 /cgi-bin/cups/ 路径的 POST 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0188.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1373","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4846","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dbab824db2d42b734971c1b87553018066aa35d2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0511.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0511","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0511.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6a16668a1632a04fd23488d1308b95bb656fd69/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0511.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/458762a518138a26e597ac195eb82ce6c30238eb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-2q76-rgp3-v4w5/GHSA-2q76-rgp3-v4w5.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0511.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0511.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--93ae6467-99d9-4f12-91a3-2af76980d1f1.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0574.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0574.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0574.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0573","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0573.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0510","title":"Easy Software Products CUPS 畸形 IPP 请求拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Easy Software Products 的 CUPS（Common Unix Printing System）在 1.1.4-3 及更早版本中，对 IPP（Internet Printing Protocol）请求处理不当。远程攻击者无需身份认证，即可向目标打印服务发送畸形 IPP 请求，触发拒绝服务，导致打印服务不可用。该漏洞影响网络可达的 CUPS 服务，攻击条件为可访问目标 IPP 端口，利用方式为构造并发送异常 IPP 报文，CVSS 约 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0510"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:53Z","remediation":"立即将 CUPS 升级至 1.0.5 或更高版本，或对 1.0.4 及更早版本下载并应用官方 cups-DoS.patch 后重新编译安装 cupsd；若暂无法升级，在防火墙将 631/tcp（IPP）仅放行内网可信主机并禁止公网访问，同时关闭不必要的远程打印共享。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0188.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1373","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4846","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d2be4eb036a20db5be632f5ca0ba66a631c4d156/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0510.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0510","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0510.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f59a7fbf5b47ecd49b181f13f4091ea609ec99d4/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0510.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/458762a518138a26e597ac195eb82ce6c30238eb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-86pm-xpc9-jgrw/GHSA-86pm-xpc9-jgrw.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0510.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0510.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--54e54f0b-b859-4f0c-8cdf-f032f5a25d6d.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0573.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0476","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0476.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0607","title":"Mandrake/RedHat Linux Kon2 fld 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Linux 系统中 Kanji on Console (KON) 软件包的 fld 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 fld 程序提供包含超长 CHARSET_REGISTRY 或 CHARSET_ENCODING 设置的输入文件触发缓冲区溢出，成功利用后可获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Mandrake 7.0/7.1 及 RedHat Kon2 0.3.9 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可实施攻击，可导致目标系统机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0607"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:05Z","remediation":"升级 Kon2 至 0.3.10 或更高版本，或移除 /usr/bin/fld 的 setuid 权限位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/fld）作为临时缓解措施。对于仍在运行的 Mandrake 7.x/RedHat 6.x 等已停止支持的系统，建议升级至受支持的操作系统版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1371","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.21.0006192340340.19998-100000%40ferret.lmh.ox.ac.uk","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20024","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0607.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-20