tatus":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0345.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1411","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.21.0006211351280.23780-100000%40nimue.tpi.pl","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20046","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0577.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0577","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0577.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0577.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9p4q-mfc9-w6m9/GHSA-9p4q-mfc9-w6m9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0577.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/b3f8802d959465aac8f9cdd0806abe7fb52f94b5/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0460.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0460.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0460.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0419","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0419.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0500","title":"BEA Systems WebLogic Express 源代码泄露漏洞","description":"BEA WebLogic Express 3.1.8/4/5 及其基础版本 WebLogic 5.1.0 存在源代码泄露漏洞。该漏洞源于系统默认配置中 servlet 处理 `/file/` 开头的请求时，未经任何安全检查就直接显示源代码文件的内容，导致攻击者能够轻易获取应用程序的源代码。这种安全缺陷允许未经身份验证的远程攻击者通过简单地向目标系统发送包含 `/file/` 前缀的HTTP请求，直接访问服务器上的源代码文件，从而暴露了系统的内部实现细节和潜在的敏感信息。这不仅破坏了信息的保密性，还可能为攻击者提供进一步攻击系统的信息支持。该漏洞影响范围广泛，攻击条件简单，利用方式直接，严重威胁了Web应用的安全性和信息保护。官方安全公告中已确认此漏洞的存在，并建议用户更新到最新补丁版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0500"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:52Z","remediation":"升级至 BEA WebLogic 6.0 或更高版本（已修复该默认配置问题）；或在 web.xml 中移除/禁用默认 servlet 的 /file/* 映射；临时缓解可在 Web 服务器/防火墙层面拦截所有以 /file/ 开头的请求路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96161462915381&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1378","http://www.weblogic.com/docs51/admindocs/http.html#file","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4775","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20027","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2000/CVE-2000-0500.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0500.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0500","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0500.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j4g2-g246-6526/GHSA-j4g2-g246-6526.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0500.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/dark-warlord14/Unofficial-OSWE-Exam-Notes/blob/031d7fbe69f52a1f2fa93ab0e5fd5f355d9b98af/more_notes/perl.md","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--062d6540-cb36-4617-9700-335d747c1187.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0419.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0419.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0419.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0610","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0610.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0533","title":"SGI IRIX WorkShop cvconnect 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX WorkShop 中的 cvconnect 工具存在任意文件写入漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 cvconnect 传递特制参数，利用其对文件路径的校验缺陷，将恶意内容写入系统任意文件，从而覆盖关键配置文件或可执行文件，实现权限提升。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可利用，影响系统机密性、完整性和可用性。SGI 已发布安全补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0533"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:56Z","remediation":"立即应用 SGI 安全公告 20000601-01-P 中提供的补丁，升级 cvconnect 组件至修复版本。如无法打补丁，限制本地用户对 cvconnect 的访问权限，仅授权可信用户使用该工具，并监控 /tmp 等可写目录的异常文件创建行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1379","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4725","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0533.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0533","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/32286684634cb7274b436e1f3bc41f1accc1edc6/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0533.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0533.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-f35j-c9wq-qjhp/GHSA-f35j-c9wq-qjhp.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0533.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/52d3e0a1025a91055dcef583f66a4f089434097e/2000.tsv","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0533.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0610.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0519","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0519.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0466","title":"IBM AIX cdmount 本地特权提升漏洞","description":"AIX cdmount 命令存在命令注入漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 cdmount 命令传递精心构造的 Shell 元字符（如分号、反引号等），注入并以 root 权限执行任意 Shell 命令，从而实现本地权限提升至 root。该漏洞影响 IBM AIX 操作系统的 cdmount 命令，攻击条件为攻击者已拥有本地低权限账户访问权限且能调用 cdmount 命令，利用方式为在命令参数中注入 Shell 元字符执行任意代码，CVSS 评分 7.2（高危），影响机密性、完整性和可用性均为完全影响。IBM 已发布补丁修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0466"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:47Z","remediation":"升级 AIX 至 5.1 TL06 SP4 或更高版本，并安装 IBM 发布的 IY13244 补丁修复 cdmount 命令注入漏洞。若无法立即升级，请使用 chmod 4750 限制 cdmount 仅允许可信用户执行，并配置 /etc/security/user 中的 shell=/bin/false 限制受影响账户的 shell 访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1384","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise55.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0466.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0466","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0466.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0466.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f7w2-c6cq-8jqg/GHSA-f7w2-c6cq-8jqg.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0466.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b144fec8-7de2-449b-b857-149273e20156.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0519.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0748","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0748.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0620","title":"Open Group X11r6 libX11 资源掩码拒绝服务漏洞","description":"libX11 X 库在处理资源掩码时存在拒绝服务漏洞，当资源掩码被设置为 0 时，libX11 会进入无限循环，导致服务不可用。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统发送特制的 X11 协议请求触发该漏洞，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Open Group X11r6 3.3.3 至 4.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0620"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:07Z","remediation":"升级至 X11R6 4.0.1 及以上版本，该版本修复了资源掩码为 0 时 libX11 进入死循环的缺陷。对于无法升级的旧系统，可在应用层对 X11 连接请求中的资源掩码参数进行校验，拒绝掩码为 0 的请求以缓解拒绝服务风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96146116627474&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1409","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4996","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0620.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0620","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0620.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb772dcb04525a1a88049530e1b1081f8633cb88/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0620.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-48mx-245h-4c59/GHSA-48mx-245h-4c59.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0620.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0e85afe9-ff2e-404e-9d48-c44f2710a090.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0620.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/2c6d191575b7724d8968135dff310ae23077248e/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0748.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0652","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0652.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0561","title":"International Telecommunications WebBBS 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"WebBBS 1.15 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的超长 HTTP GET 请求触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，进而实现任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 International Telecommunications WebBBS 1.15 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。目前厂商已停止维护该产品，建议用户迁移至其他受支持的论坛系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0561"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:00Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 WebBBS 1.15 并迁移至受维护的论坛系统（如 phpBB、Discourse 等）。若短期内无法迁移，在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面限制 HTTP GET 请求 URI 长度不超过 2048 字节，例如 Apache 中配置 LimitRequestLine 2048，Nginx 中设置 large_client_header_buffers 4 8k。同时将 WebBBS CGI 脚本的执行目录设置为 noexec 挂载选项，并通过 WAF 规则拦截超长 GET 请求作为临时缓解措施。该软件已于 2000 年后停止维护，无官方补丁可用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0175.html","http://www.osvdb.org/3544","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1365","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4742","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0561.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0561","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0561.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0561.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-485w-vv83-53fx/GHSA-485w-vv83-53fx.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0561.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2bf92a19-8fb1-44f7-9ada-cb72e1d4e1f4.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0561.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0652.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0602","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0602.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0529","title":"Network Associates Net Tools PKI Server 1.0 HTTP Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Network Associates Net Tools PKI Server 1.0 的 HTTP Server 组件存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送超长的 HTTP 请求，导致服务进程崩溃或停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响 Net Tools PKI Server 1.0 版本。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0529"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:55Z","remediation":"立即从 ftp://ftp.tis.com/gauntlet/hide/pki/hotfix.txt 下载并安装官方热修复补丁。该补丁通过限制 HTTP 请求长度来防止缓冲区溢出导致的拒绝服务。如无法获取补丁，可在防火墙或反向代理层面设置 HTTP 请求 URI 长度上限（建议不超过 1024 字节），并过滤异常长请求。由于 Net Tools PKI Server 1.0 已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的 PKI 服务器产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0166.html","http://www.osvdb.org/4352","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1363","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4744","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0529.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0529","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/11a92cc3c0d31b9e78fe8f2a857dd04df3195701/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0529.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0529.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-3mxj-r9f3-w6jf/GHSA-3mxj-r9f3-w6jf.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playgrou